{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121020635231-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121114859\"/><p>昨日（20日）網上流傳一段影片，地點為元朗擊壤路巴士總站對開。片中所見一輛白色私家車途經上址時，約有5名男子突然由暗處衝出馬路，部分人手持高爾夫球棒及硬物，疑上前追打該車。</p><p>涉事私家車逆線駛入巴士總站，在現場兜繞兩圈後，加速揚長而去，影片隨即結束。期間片主叫車內女子唔好落車及鎖門。惟未知事發日期及時間。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:03:47.759613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T18:06:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:37:14.214184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:25.626688+00:00","content_hash":"7bb4f35401385583e43885df72ec7801821f987e46cb386edc861a04428d0e3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:03:47.759613+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}